---
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslatedPath } from "@i18n/utils";

const { class: className } = Astro.props;

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const translatePath = useTranslatedPath(lang);

const paragraphs = [
	"We research devices, both benign and compromised, and the software that runs on them. We reverse-engineer applications, find vulnerabilities, and examine seized phones to establish what happened during a compromise. We work from the evidence available, reproduce what we can, and distinguish what the evidence shows from what we can only infer. We report vulnerabilities to those responsible for fixing them and document methods of surveillance so others can recognise them.",
	"The people most likely to be targeted by spyware rarely have the resources to investigate it themselves. Journalists, human rights defenders, lawyers and civil society organisations face adversaries with specialist tools and technical expertise, while the means to investigate these threats remain concentrated in a handful of companies and specialist laboratories. Civil society should not have to rely on them to understand what has happened to its own devices.",
	"We build open-source forensic tools that allow investigators to examine devices remotely and investigate suspicious activity. We develop them in-house and in the open, without outsourcing or subgranting the engineering work. The software runs locally wherever possible, and the evidence remains under the control of those conducting the investigation.",
	"We also conduct forensic investigations ourselves. Tools can collect data, but interpreting it requires an understanding of how devices work, where evidence comes from, and what it can establish. We publish our findings so others can build on what we learn.",
	"Our aim is to put the means of investigating digital surveillance into the hands of the people facing it.",
];
---

<section id="operating-standards" class:list={["section !py-24 lg:!py-36", className]}>
	<div class="col-span-12 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
		<h2 class="section-title">How we work</h2>
		<div class="mt-16 max-w-5xl space-y-8 lg:mt-20">
			{paragraphs.map((text) => <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">{text}</p>)}
		</div>
		<div class="mt-12">
			<a href={translatePath("/about/")} class="btn btn-solid">About us</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
